Package: iptv
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: mariadb-server (>= 10.5), redis-server (>= 5.0)
Maintainer: jeriveromartinez <jeriveromartinez@gmail.com>
Description: SofaScore scraper + admin panel for IPTV
 Scrapes SofaScore events and serves the web admin panel plus the
 IPTV-facing API. Installs a systemd service (iptv.service) and
 configuration in /etc/iptv.
